490: /**
491:  * Low-level transport helper that executes the `agy` process directly with raw prompt,
492:  * handling timeout, recursion protection, and envelope parsing.
493:  *
494:  * Supports both signatures:
495:  * - invokeTransport({ slug, prompt, ...opts })
496:  * - invokeTransport(slug, prompt, opts)
497:  *
498:  * @param {string|object} slugOrOpts
499:  * @param {string} [maybePrompt]
500:  * @param {object} [maybeOpts]
501:  * @returns {object} Structured result
502:  */
